l,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null},{"id":517,"title":"Senior Junior Library Content Section jankipuram","content":"<p>The school maintains two dedicated library spaces&mdash;the Junior Library and the Senior Library&mdash;designed to support students at every stage of their academic and personal reading journey. Together, they foster a strong reading culture, encourage independent inquiry, and provide quiet, well-resourced environments for learning.&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<p>The Senior Library<br>Designed for middle, secondary, and senior secondary students, the Senior Library serves as an academic hub for research, exam preparation, and focused self-study.<\/p>\r\n<p>Comprehensive Resources : Offers a wide range of reference books, subject-specific guides, competitive exam preparation material (such as JEE, NEET, CUET, and Olympiad resources), classic and contemporary literature, biographies, and periodicals.<\/p>\r\n<p>Study &amp; Research Space : Features quiet reading zones, spacious study tables, and structured cataloguing to help students locate academic texts and conduct project research efficiently.<\/p>\r\n<p>Digital &amp; Periodical Access : Provides access to daily newspapers, educational magazines, and digital learning resources to keep students updated on current affairs and global developments.<\/p>\r\n<p>Supporting Holistic Growth<br>Both libraries are managed systematically to ensure smooth circulation, regular stock updates, and guidance in book selection. Through annual book fairs, reading challenges, and library periods integrated into the weekly timetable, the school ensures that every student develops strong reading habits and information literacy skills.<\/p>","content_type":"text","image_path":null,"image_url":null,"link_url":null,"video_path":null,"video_url":null,"table_data":null,"accordion_data":null,"order":1,"is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-20T04:45:06.453000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:33:08.390000Z","page_section_id":"1175","content_heading":null,"alignment":null,"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null}]},{"id":1178,"title":"Senior Junior Library Section jankipuram","description":null,"order":3,"layout":"content","is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-20T04:45:37.910000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T04:45:37.910000Z","page_id":"573","content":null,"content_heading":null,"table_json_data":null,"accordion_json_data":null,"gallery_json_data":null,"section_type":"content","alignment":"left","background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#333333","padding_top":"50","padding_bottom":"50","content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null,"section_layout_id":null,"columns":[{"id":518,"title":"Senior Junior Library Content Section jankipuram","content":"<p>The Junior Library<br>Tailored for early learners and primary-grade students, the Junior Library focuses on building foundational literacy and sparking a lifelong love for books.<\/p>\r\n<p>Engaging Environment : Bright, welcoming seating and low, accessible bookshelves allow young readers to browse independently and comfortably.<\/p>\r\n<p>Curated Collection : Houses illustrated picture books, phonics readers, fairy tales, beginner encyclopedias, and age-appropriate fiction in English and Hindi.<\/p>\r\n<p>Interactive Activities : Hosts regular storytelling sessions, read-aloud hours, book-talk circles, and vocabulary games to develop listening and comprehension skills.<\/p>","content_type":"text","image_path":null,"image_url":null,"link_url":null,"video_path":null,"video_url":null,"table_data":null,"accordion_data":null,"order":1,"is_active":true,"created_at":"2025-09-20T04:46:12.830000Z","updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:33:41.717000Z","page_section_id":"1178","content_heading":null,"alignment":null,"image_alt":null,"column_type":null,"width":"50","image_width":null,"image_height":null,"content_item_id":null,"content_item_type":null},{"